BUTTON  chk2(125, 25, 195, 45)  '수량저장'  TP_CHECK|EDIT_NOP          COLOR(200, 232)  CUR(0)      TABORDER(2)  ENABLE  &
  VISIBLE  HINTTYPE(IH_NONE)
